servation_status_date`):\n","Date information helps us study trends over time, such as seasonal patterns in bookings and prices. The column `reservation_status_date` is currently stored as text and will be converted to a proper datetime type during data cleaning.\n","\n","**Why this step matters:**\n","Separating numerical, categorical and date columns tells us which statistical methods and charts are suitable for each feature, so the rest of the analysis stays accurate and meaningful."],"metadata":{"id":"PRjAdPUZf5my"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## 2. Data Cleaning & Preprocessing\n","### 2.1 Checking Missing Values"],"metadata":{"id":"N72nIklshX_l"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["missing = df.isnull().sum()\n","percent = (missing / len(df) * 100).round(2)\n","missing_df = pd.DataFrame({'Missing': missing, 'Percent': percent})\n","missing_df = missing_df[missing_df.Missing > 0].sort_values('Missing', ascending=False)\n","display(missing_df)\n","\n","missing_df['Percent'].plot(kind='barh', title='Missing Values (%) by Column')\n","plt.xlabel('Percent Missing')\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":731},"id":"lIgyZeqdhZQA","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793020247215,"user_tz":-300,"elapsed":294,"user":{"displayName":"Aman Khan","userId":"09985907427626621176"}},"outputId":"540d5f3e-9ceb-453f-b829-dfa6fa010cdb"},"execution_count":67,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["          Missing  Percent\n","company    112593    94.31\n","agent       16340    13.69\n","country       488     0.41\n","children        4     0.00"],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-ea34ef6c-44e0-4229-bcf5-f8d1bb534ea1\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-